OL,3,GNEWSAControversial supermarket plan for
OL,4,AHelensburgh waterfront rejected
OL,5,
OL,6,FA controversial plan to site a
OL,7,Fsupermarket on Helensburgh's waterfront
OL,8,Fhas been rejected by Argyll & Bute
OL,9,FCouncil after "significant local
OL,10,Fopposition".
OL,12,FThe proposal would have placed the
OL,13,Fsupermarket on vacant common good land
OL,14,Fin front of the town's leisure centre,
OL,15,Falong with three smaller retail units
OL,16,Fand a skatepark.
OL,18,FThe scheme prompted local protests,
OL,19,Fwith a consultation showing 94.8 per
OL,20,Fcent of more than 3,400 responses were
OL,21,Fagainst the plan.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
