OL,3,GNEWSAControversial supermarket plan for
OL,4,AHelensburgh waterfront rejected
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe local authority has now decided to
OL,7,Frefer the task of identifying options
OL,8,Ffor the future of the waterfront to the
OL,9,FHelensburgh and Lomond Area Committee.
